# 统一换行符，避免 Windows/Linux 协作时整文件 diff
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制文件不做换行转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.apk binary
*.aab binary
*.keystore binary
*.tar.gz binary
*.zip binary

# GitHub 语言统计：把文档类归到 Markdown，避免它们压过源码
docs/*.md linguist-documentation
README.md linguist-documentation
